message: "If you use LLMQA in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "LLMQA: LLM Quality Assurance"
abstract: >-
  An open-source harness that makes LLM quality measurable, reviewable, and
  gate-able in CI: golden datasets, pluggable metrics (exact match, similarity,
  LLM-as-judge, hallucination/grounding), and quality + regression gates.
type: software
